","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970108c.pdf","v":""},{"id":129709,"q":"I hope that this morning I have given you some insights into what we think should be in the central banker's rucksack, and how the United Kingdom will assess its own preparedness next year, when the time comes.","sp":"Mervyn King","ss":"mervyn-king","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-12-16 00:00","a":"combination","ax":"oracular","tl":"Partly testable","am":56,"p":0.85,"h":"1997-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970108c.pdf","v":""},{"id":129708,"q":"Once again, that is an issue which we will have to consider carefully as we assess the position of the United Kingdom next year.","sp":"Mervyn King","ss":"mervyn-king","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-12-16 00:00","a":"combination","ax":"oracular","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":"1997-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970108c.pdf","v":""},{"id":252458,"q":"Next year will be a decisive year for the future of the Third Pillar.","sp":"COMMISSIONER GRADIN","ss":"commissioner-gradin","in":"European Commission","c":"EU","t":"1996-12-12 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"oracular","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":"1997-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/speech_96_328","v":""},{"id":252473,"q":"in the average fuel consumption of cars that will go on the street in 2005,","sp":"European Commission","ss":"european-commission","in":"European Commission","c":"EU","t":"1996-12-05 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":"2005-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/speech_96_320","v":""},{"id":252472,"q":"that a 10% reduction by 2005 could be feasible.","sp":"European Commis