ght be maintained within the framework of the third phase of Commerce 2000","sp":"EUROPEAN COMMISSIONER CHRISTOS PAPOUTSIS","ss":"european-commissioner-christos-papoutsis","in":"European Commission","c":"EU","t":"1996-11-14 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":56,"p":0.35,"h":"2000-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/speech_96_285","v":""},{"id":129689,"q":"It is anticipated that the annual growth rate will exceed 9.5%.","sp":"Dai Xianglong","ss":"dai-xianglong","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-11-13 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":null,"st":"open","stl":"Not due yet","tp":["growth"],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970211b.pdf","v":""},{"id":129688,"q":"It is expected that the growth rate for the whole year will be around 6.5%.","sp":"Dai Xianglong","ss":"dai-xianglong","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-11-13 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":56,"p":0.7,"h":null,"st":"open","stl":"Not due yet","tp":["growth"],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970211b.pdf","v":""},{"id":129687,"q":"I would also like to announce that an association of mainland banks will be formed this year.","sp":"Dai Xianglong","ss":"dai-xianglong","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-11-13 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"oracular","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":"1996-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":["finance"],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970211b.pdf","v":""},{"id":129686,"q":"We are certain that our reserves will exceed US$ 100 billion by the end of the year.","sp":"Dai Xianglong","ss":"dai-xianglong","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-11-13 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":"1996-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970211b.pdf","v":""},{"id":129685,"q":"It is expected that the total money supply at the end of this year will be 26% higher than the previous year.","sp":"Dai Xianglong","ss":"dai-xianglong","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-11-13 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.7,"h":"1996-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970211b.pdf","v":""},{"id":129684,"q":"Based on the above considerations, it is desirable that next year's target annual GNP growth rate should be set at 8-9% while the retail price increase be contained at a level below 6%.","sp":"Dai Xianglong","ss":"dai-xianglong","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-11-13 00:00","a":"combination","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":null,"h":"1997-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":["growth"],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970211b.pdf","v":""},{"id":252571,"q":"framework of the \"Sound and Efficient Management 2000\" project, and I will","sp":"European Commission","ss":"european-commission","in":"European Commission","c":"EU","t":"1996-11-12 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":"2000-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/speech_96_279","v":""},{"id":252580,"q":"estimated 2% of GDP, and the further damage to transport efficiency will","sp":"European Commission","ss":"european-commission","in":"European Commission","c":"EU","t":"1996-11-11 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":null,"st":"open","stl":"Not due yet","tp":["growth"],"u":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/speech_96_280","v":""},{"id":129727,"q":"Even when price indexes remain stable during a certain period, price stability in the medium to long term could be at risk if the economy is overheating and creating potential upward pressures on prices.","sp":"Yasuo Matsushita","ss":"yasuo-matsushita","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-11-06 00:00","a":"scenario","ax":"abductive","tl":"Partly testable","am":56,"p":0.35,"h":null,"st":"open","stl":"Not due yet","tp":["inflation"],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970107a.pdf","v":""},{"id":129726,"q":"In addition, if there is a downward rigidity in certain prices and wages due to business practices and contractual constraints, the cost of achieving zero inflation could become substantial.","sp":"Yasuo Matsushita","ss":"yasuo-matsushita","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-11-06 00:00","a":"scenario","ax":"abductive","tl":"Partly testable","am":56,"p":0.35,"h":null,"st":"open","stl":"Not due yet","tp":["inflation","labour"],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970107a.pdf","v":""},{"id":129725,"q":"If prices in general increase, that is, if inflation occurs, the amount of goods that can be purchased for ¥10,000 will decrease, which means that the value of ¥10,000 will decline.","sp":"Yasuo Matsushita","ss":"yasuo-matsushita","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-11-06 00:00","a":"scenario","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":null,"st":"open","stl":"Not due yet","tp":["inflation"],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970107a.pdf","v":""},{"id":129724,"q":"In view of this economic situation, the Bank will continue, in the management of current monetary policy, to monitor monetary and economic developments closely, placing emphasis on further strengthening the foundation for an economic recovery.","sp":"Yasuo Matsushita","ss":"yasuo-matsushita","in":"Central bank (via BIS)","c":"INT","t":"1996-11-06 00:00","a":"strategic announcement","ax":"oracular","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":null,"st":"open","stl":"Not due yet","tp":["interest rates","finance"],"u":"https://www.bis.org/review/r970107a.pdf","v":""},{"id":252606,"q":"I hope it will prove possible, before the end of the year, to complete the","sp":"European Commission","ss":"european-commission","in":"European Commission","c":"EU","t":"1996-11-05 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"oracular","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":"1996-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/speech_96_270","v":""},{"id":252603,"q":"At the beginning of next year, the Commission will then present a formal","sp":"European Commission","ss":"european-commission","in":"European Commission","c":"EU","t":"1996-11-05 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"oracular","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":"1997-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/speech_96_269","v":""},{"id":252629,"q":"- and there will the preparations for Agenda 2000 - enlargement and the","sp":"JACQUES SANTER","ss":"jacques-santer","in":"European Commission","c":"EU","t":"1996-10-22 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":"2000-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/speech_96_260","v":""},{"id":252628,"q":"Commission will submit a communication on the financial framework from 2000","sp":"JACQUES SANTER","ss":"jacques-santer","in":"European Commission","c":"EU","t":"1996-10-22 00:00","a":"forecast","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":"2000-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/speech_96_260","v":""},{"id":252627,"q":"In 1997 we will be launching the third stage of the SEM 2000 programme","sp":"JACQUES SANTER","ss":"jacques-santer","in":"European Commission","c":"EU","t":"1996-10-22 00:00","a":"combination","ax":"empirical","tl":"Partly testable","am":36,"p":0.85,"h":"2000-12-31","st":"due","stl":"Due - being checked","tp":[],"u":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/speech_96_260","v":